Barbara Ann Stinson, a native or Evergreen and 60-plus year resident of Brewton, peacefully passed away June 22, 2026 at her home in North Brewton.

Ms. Stinson worked with D.W. McMillan Memorial Hospital for many years prior to joining AAA Cooper Transportation from where she retired.

She is survived by son,Jason Griggers and grandson London Griggers of Atlanta, Ga.; daughter Robin Griggers and grandsons Cruz Reed and Walker Griggers of Brewton; great-grandson Lucas Griggers of Marianna Fla.;

